  "useWhen": "DOC announces a live session with its speakers.",
  "notWhen": "there is only a date so far (use `DOC Save the Date`).",
  "paperFileId": "01M4GYN0DT5HC9MZK7YVRYA3CW",
  "guidance": [
    "headline-1, headline-2: the question the session answers, in two weights (\"What does a P&L / actually tell you?\").",
    "event-name (\"DOC Live session\") and datetime (\"Sept 28 • 7:00 PM ET\"): only real details from the brief.",
    "Speakers: one to three. Each has a real photo (a grey silhouette until it comes), a name and a role or track. Speakers 2 and 3 are optional; leave them out to drop them.",
    "cta: \"Save your seat\" on every theme.",
    "Copy in US English, in the DOC voice: plain, specific, second person, no exclamation marks. Never invent a figure, price, date, module count, quote or name.",
    "Themes: Foundations, Startup and Acquisition are the three tracks (red, purple, green grounds): use the one the piece is about, never mix tracks. Dark and Light are neutral, for the collective as a whole."
